ta-lazy-src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-9.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-59822 size-full entered lazyloaded\" title=\"Thiết kế cải tạo căn hộ chung cư Vinhomes Ba Son Quận 1\" src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-7.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-7.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-7-768x960.jpg 768w\" alt=\"Thiết kế cải tạo căn hộ chung cư Vinhomes Ba Son Quận 1\" width=\"900\" height=\"1125\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-7.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-7-768x960.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-7.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-59823 size-full entered lazyloaded\" title=\"Thiết kế cải tạo căn hộ chung cư Vinhomes Ba Son Quận 1\" src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-8.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-8.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-8-768x960.jpg 768w\" alt=\"Thiết kế cải tạo căn hộ chung cư Vinhomes Ba Son Quận 1\" width=\"900\" height=\"1125\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-8.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-8-768x960.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-8.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\"></p>\n<h3>Bố trí từng không gian</h3>\n<h4>Phòng khách</h4>\n<p>Phòng khách: Được thiết kế theo “đường dẫn” trên trần, dẫn tầm nhìn vào không gian chính; phòng khách linh hoạt, có thể biến thành phòng ngủ phụ khi cần. Vật liệu đặc trưng mây tre đan và các vật liệu tự nhiên giúp giữ nét truyền thống của Wabi Sabi, tạo cảm giác gần gũi, thân thiện.</p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-59831 size-full entered lazyloaded\" title=\"Thiết kế cải tạo căn hộ chung cư Vinhomes Ba Son Quận 1\" src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-13.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-13.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-13-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-13-720x720.jpg 720w\" alt=\"Thiết kế cải tạo căn hộ chung cư Vinhomes Ba Son Quận 1\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-13.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-ba-son-quan-1-13-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/05/thiet-ke-cai-tao-can-ho-chung-cu-vinhomes-