\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-3.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-3-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-3-720x720.jpg 720w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-3.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-59496 size-full entered lazyloaded\" title=\"Thiết kế cầu thang lầu 1 nhà phố 8x20m\" src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4-720x720.jpg 720w\" alt=\"Thiết kế cầu thang lầu 1 nhà phố 8x20m\" width=\"900\" height=\"900\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4-768x768.jpg 768w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4-720x720.jpg 720w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-cau-thang-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-4.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\"></p>\n<h4>Phòng bếp</h4>\n<p>Thiết kế bếp&nbsp;tách biệt với phòng khách → giữ mùi hiệu quả, không ảnh hưởng sinh hoạt chung.<br>Thoáng và đủ sáng nhờ cửa sổ, giếng trời gần kề → không bí như nhiều kiểu bếp đóng.<br>Bố trí khoa học tối ưu công năng: khu rửa – sơ chế – nấu nướng thuận tiện.<br>Trang bị hiện đại: hút mùi, tủ âm, kệ cao tận dụng không gian → gọn, sạch, dễ thao tác.</p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-59497 size-full entered lazyloaded\" title=\"Thiết kế nội thất phòng bếp lầu 1 nhà phố 8x20m\" src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-1.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-1.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-1-768x576.jpg 768w\" alt=\"Thiết kế nội thất phòng bếp lầu 1 nhà phố 8x20m\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-1.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-1-768x576.jpg 768w\" data-lazy-sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" data-lazy-src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-1.jpg\" data-ll-status=\"loaded\"></p>\n<p><img class=\"aligncenter wp-image-59498 size-full entered lazyloaded\" title=\"Thiết kế nội thất phòng bếp lầu 1 nhà phố 8x20m\" src=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-2.jpg\" sizes=\"(max-width: 900px) 100vw, 900px\" srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-2.jpg 900w, https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-phong-bep-lau-1-nha-pho-8x20m-2-768x576.jpg 768w\" alt=\"Thiết kế nội thất phòng bếp lầu 1 nhà phố 8x20m\" width=\"900\" height=\"675\" data-lazy-srcset=\"https://ankhoadesign.com.vn/wp-content/uploads/2025/04/thiet-ke-noi-that-ph